{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-08_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-08","title":"No Promises","storyCode":"2-8","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8b8f59f602cbcebd821cf94abd7c829744e683a53225c6a457fd8effb25e2896","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka, Liskarm, be aware of our surroundings."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll take Misha to Madam Ch'en."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"You're late again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Lungmen doesn't want any more security risks."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en, our escort team was attacked multiple times by Reunion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"In fact, they're still around as we speak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not safe here. Please take Misha and leave as soon as possible."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"And you're Misha?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I am..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"From now on, you will follow the L.G.D.'s arrangements."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"PC94172, you're in charge of this girl."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Come with me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en, I don't know what Lungmen needs her for..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But I hope that you can ensure her safety."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We already treat the Infected very well."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I see..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But, Misha is not in good health."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We hope that Lungmen will allow her to live in Rhodes Island after this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...I'll send an application to Chief Wei."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Lungmen will transfer her to Rhodes Island if she passes our checks with no other issues."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...That is, if there aren't any problems."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It shouldn't take long."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...We'll part ways for the time being, Misha."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island welcomes you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, while I'm gone, please protect those kids in the slums."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Oh, that's right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No problem, you have my promise!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"By the way, Misha..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Next time, could you teach me... how to make dolls?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"...Hehe."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm, sure."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Is our mission over now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island will have their hands tied the more they get dragged into all this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"But, Lungmen is still keeping a lot of secrets from us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Lungmen doesn't seem to care about us too much..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"But the opposite seems to be true for Reunion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"The enemy wants to attack the district we're staying at."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Even though I've heard about it, Lungmen's architecture sure is complex!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"This entire street is actually built on rooftops..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"...and that's giving our enemies a huge advantage to exploit!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion is attacking again...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"They've even chased us all the way out here?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why do they... want Misha so badly?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["Misha"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["L.G.D. Agent"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Franka","Liskarm"]}]}
